<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="KR5c0126-zh-b1ff58bb" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>庄子译注与解析</title><editor role="translator">Zhang Songhui 张松辉</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>庄子译注与解析</title>北京：中華書局，2011</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#KR5c0126"><title xml:lang="och">莊子</title></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="zh">modern Chinese</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2026-08-23T22:50:33.838+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="KR5c0126-start"><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.32" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:07:41.159+09:00">他们的做法与善于治理天下的做法相距大遥远了。     【解析】这个故事通过任公子与验才讽说之徒的对比，说明要想做大事，就必须有远大的眼光和深厚的修养。】</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T22:54:54.77+09:00">任公子F做了一个巨大的鱼钩和一条巨大的黑色钓鱼绳，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T22:55:03.143+09:00">用五十头公牛做成鱼饵，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T22:55:52.659+09:00">然后蹲在会稽山上，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T22:56:04.449+09:00">把钓竿投向东海。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T22:56:21.515+09:00">他天天都在那里钓鱼，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T22:56:30.204+09:00">整整一年什么也没有钓到。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T22:56:43.03+09:00">不久有一条大鱼吞食了鱼饵，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T22:57:05.79+09:00">这条大鱼牵着巨大的钓钩</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T22:59:54.354+09:00">向海底逃去，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:00:00.026+09:00">接着又奋起鱼鳝腾身而出，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:00:22.745+09:00">掀起如山的白浪，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:00:34.136+09:00">海水急剧震荡，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:00:45.581+09:00">发出的声音如同鬼神吼叫，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:00:51.372+09:00">方圆千里的人都感到震惊。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:01:02.81+09:00">任公子钓得这样一条大鱼后，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:01:14.29+09:00">便把它剖开制成干鱼肉，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:01:40.238+09:00">从制河以东、</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:01:47.731+09:00">苍梧山以北，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:02:07.355+09:00">这一地区的人们都饱饱地吃了一餐鱼肉。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:04:43.604+09:00">后来一些知识浅薄、</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:04:50.778+09:00">道听途说的人，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:05:02.105+09:00">都吃惊地奔走相告。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.24" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:05:09.482+09:00">他们也举着细小的鱼竿和钓绳，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.25" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:06:18.427+09:00">跑到渠水、小溪边，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.26" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:06:31.171+09:00">守候着小小的鱼儿，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.27" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:06:38.744+09:00">他们如此做要想钓到大鱼实在是太难大难了。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.28" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:06:48.106+09:00">学习一些温馨琐碎的知识，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.29" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:06:57.046+09:00">到小小的县令那里去寻求官职，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.30" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:07:05.727+09:00">如此要想取得大的成功实在是大难太难了。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.31" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-23T23:07:18.692+09:00">因此那些不了解任公子志趣的人是不行的，</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>